{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792309620, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T07:47:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T07:48:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792309680, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:47:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35700, "sprite_key": "beaver_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "我走在台北的街頭上，看到很多廣告看板真的非常的亂，這跟我在日本的旅遊的差異感受非常多，希望台北市更美", "display_name": "萬華代表 Danto", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:47:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13515, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "體育", "content": "長期在國外，每年帶小朋友體驗台北生活同時也兼顧足球訓練。過去3年經驗是很難取得市立球隊的相關資訊。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.13,515", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:47:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 667, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "nangang", "topic": "育兒", "content": "我希望我的小孩從幼兒開始就能夠有穩定妥善的教育，所有的幼兒園老師都能被善待，所有協會老害都該消失", "display_name": "南港代表 張哲瑋", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:47:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10738, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "市政", "content": "10歲女童兒虐的事件，\n三十幾年前的台灣飛利浦，\n訪查三次，\n就會被改正\n台北市政府已經爛掉了", "display_name": "中山代表 No.10,738", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 13515, "sprite_key": "deer_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.13,515", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 667, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "display_name": "南港代表 張哲瑋", "district": "nangang", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 10738, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.10,738", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 51813, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb